{"title":"Titanium Fittings","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Carpentry Lv 45)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Carpentry at level 45 <span class=\"muted\">(125 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-ore\">Titanium Ore</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/carpentry\">Carpentry</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/f8c979df6344ede0f746.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Fittings</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/1fdb314593315fdc2ce6.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Fittings</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/07f49f58a10822b3bc5a.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Fittings</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-ore\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/cfbc968d785ddafb004c.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Ore</a></p>\n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/shagbark-bucket\">Shagbark Bucket</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 45</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/shagbark-storage-chest\">Shagbark Storage Chest</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 77</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/shagbark-bed\">Shagbark Bed</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 82</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/shagbark-stone-hearth\">Shagbark Stone Hearth</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 63</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/shagbark-scribes-lectern\">Shagbark Scribes Lectern</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 66</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/shagbark-pestle-and-mortar\">Shagbark Pestle And Mortar</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 69</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/shagbar